# Time-travel, for free. The whole program is a pure function of `now`, so
# `as of <instant>` just runs a line at a different present. "How many
# Schengen days will I have used the day I land — and the day I leave?"
# is one keyword, not a spreadsheet.

hamburg = 2027-02-09
timezone = Europe/Vienna

trips = 2025-12-15 .. 2025-12-23,
        2026-03-27 .. 2026-05-11,
        2026-07-03 .. 2026-07-08,
        2026-07-17 .. 2026-08-10,
        2026-11-01 .. 2026-11-13,
        hamburg .. 2027-05-01

days of trips & last 180 days                    # used today
days of trips & last 180 days as of hamburg      # used the day I land
days of trips & last 180 days as of 2027-05-01   # used the day I leave — over 90
